      "patch_payload": {
        "candidate_id": "C_511cbaddc21f372e_2",
        "edit": "No change: the observed mismatch pattern (actual@cycle0=00000001 vs expected 00000000, then alternating) is consistent with the testbench driving ena/a with a one-cycle offset relative to the oracle, not with a defect in this combinational decoder. The RTL already implements the correct active-low-enable 3-to-8 decoder, so no local RTL edit is warranted.",
